1
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,600
I pray to heaven

2
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,400
that my daughter, He Mei,

3
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,720
will return soon.

4
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:17,880
Great!

5
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:19,920
Excuse me.

6
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,480
I am He Mei.

7
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,320
Look

8
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,780
how much I resemble my dad.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,080
Follow me, everyone.

10
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,160
I am He Mei.

11
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:29,200
Where did this clown come from?

12
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,200
You are the 101st person

13
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,720
to impersonate He Mei.

14
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,320
If you were the real He Mei,

15
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,840
the master's lawyer

16
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,700
would have found you
with a paternity test long ago.

17
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,240
Throw her out.

18
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:41,560
Dad,

19
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,759
I want to be the richest man's daughter.

20
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:48,120
It seems I shouldn't reveal
my identity so rashly.

21
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,479
I need to get close to him first,

22
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:50,000
get a hair sample,

23
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,800
and do a DNA test.

24
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,840
Enjoy yourselves, everyone.

25
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,040
Will do.

26
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,600
This way, Master.

27
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,280
Safe travels, Master.

28
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,479
Take care, Master He.

29
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,360
Watch where you're going!

30
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,770
What a waste of my good red wine.

31
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,360
I'm so sorry.

32
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,260
Your clothes are all stained.

33
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,560
Let me wipe it for you.

34
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,440
Wait.

35
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:51,840
Wait.

36
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,840
Wait.

37
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:53,960
Wait a minute.

38
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,560
I was so close.

39
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,440
That damn He Shi.

40
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:03,160
It wasn't easy getting back
to the He family.

41
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,640
How can I leave so easily?

42
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,520
I have to stay here

43
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,080
until Dad comes back.

44
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,760
Li Zhangxin!

45
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:15,760
I just

46
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,760
saw you slap He Shi.

47
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,640
I was worried about you,

48
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,320
so I came to check.

49
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,160
Thank you.

50
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,079
I'm fine.

51
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,640
Do you know where the master is going

52
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,680
in such a hurry?

53
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,240
He's probably

54
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,240
going abroad for business.

55
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,020
He's on his way to the airport.

56
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:36,250
Then he probably won't be back until late.

57
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,760
I mean,

58
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,079
I really like it here.

59
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,280
I majored in nursing in college.

60
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,240
I was wondering

61
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,440
if I could apply to be

62
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,320
the second young master's
personal caregiver.

63
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,720
Since you're pregnant,

64
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,200
it's good to have some help.

65
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:54,079
Bring your documents tomorrow.

66
00:03:54,079 --> 00:03:55,640
I'll take you to see Mrs. He.

67
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,720
She has the final say

68
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,760
on everything in this manor.

69
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,320
Thank you.

70
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,920
So comfortable.

71
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:40,560
Zhang Xin,

72
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:43,080
you've taken over my mother's room
and identity.

73
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,740
You're living quite the life.

74
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:47,200
Your dream will end soon,

75
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,440
because I'm back.

76
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,000
Mrs. He,

77
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,800
this is Li Zhangxin,
the one I mentioned yesterday

78
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:56,480
who wants to be
He Yu's personal caregiver.

79
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,800
She majored in nursing in college.

80
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:09,360
Taking care of He Yu all by myself

81
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,560
is indeed a bit overwhelming right now.

82
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:14,840
I need a professional to help me.

83
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,520
Hello, Mrs. He.

84
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,280
Here is my resume.

85
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,360
Mrs. He,

86
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,240
Rongcheng University.

87
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,560
A top student, huh?

88
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,560
I won a scholarship every year.

89
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,760
I also graduated at the top of my class.

90
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,800
What are you showing off for?

91
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,280
Fine,

92
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,240
let's do a three-month probation.

93
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,600
No way.

94
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:02,960
Mrs. He,

95
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:03,880
this woman

96
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:06,120
is a temp hired for yesterday's banquet.

97
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,440
She refused to follow my orders.

98
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,240
Instead of working
properly in the kitchen,

99
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,440
she ran around everywhere.

100
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,960
She even slapped the young master.

101
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:13,080
How can we keep her?

102
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:22,480
You even dared to hit He Shi.

103
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,640
You settle her in.

104
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,000
Understood, Mrs. He.

105
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,960
I'll get you settled.

106
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,840
The He family has a strict hierarchy.

107
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,400
If you make a mistake here,

108
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,840
no one can save you.

109
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,640
Do you hear me?

110
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,960
Here we are.

111
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,200
This is your room.

112
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,960
Aren't there a few empty rooms?

113
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,840
Why do I have to stay in the storage room?

114
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:01,960
You're new here.

115
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,560
You have to do as you're told.

116
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,840
Watch your step.

117
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,280
Don't scratch the floor.

118
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,340
What are you doing?

119
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:16,760
Are you crazy?

120
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:19,020
You'll have to pay if you get these dirty.

121
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:20,880
Fine.

122
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,210
I'm so sorry about that.

123
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,160
You just tripped me.

124
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,160
If I had accidentally

125
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:26,760
broken something here,

126
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,440
who would take the blame?

127
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,560
Fine.

128
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,320
You've got guts.

129
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,360
Wash all of these clean.

130
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,860
As if I can't deal with you.

131
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,159
Butler Liu,

132
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,520
this is just the beginning.

133
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,680
You've got some nerve

134
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,440
coming here for a job.

135
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,680
You really don't know the rules.

136
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:09,920
In the He family,

137
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,360
my dad has

138
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,770
the highest status.

139
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,160
Next is

140
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,160
Madam He,

141
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,960
and then me.

142
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,880
At the very bottom

143
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,800
are you servants.

144
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,559
So,

145
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,520
when you see me,

146
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,559
you must greet me.

147
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,840
And

148
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,040
when I talk to you,

149
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,680
you must respond.

150
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,840
Understood, Young Master.

151
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,360
Do you have any other orders?

152
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,680
If not,

153
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:54,040
please leave.

154
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,400
This is my private space.

155
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:56,960
Private space?

156
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,680
Everything in the He family is mine,

157
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,160
including you.

158
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,880
So there are

159
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,960
no human rights in the He family.

160
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:11,400
Your name is Li Zhangxin, right?

161
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,960
I, He Shi, have seen all kinds of women.

162
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:17,980
Do you really think

163
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,920
you're that charming?

164
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,000
Then what is the Young Master

165
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,560
doing right now?

166
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,160
Let go.

167
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:30,880
Let go.

168
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,080
Honey,

169
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,720
Mrs. He wants to see you.

170
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,400
Are you okay?

171
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:56,440
I'm fine.

172
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,920
You need to be careful of He Shi

173
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,520
in the He family from now on.

174
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:01,410
He's definitely not a good guy.

175
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,640
Especially a beautiful woman like you,

176
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,320
it's easy to become his prey.

177
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:07,260
You know what kind of person he is,

178
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,650
so why did you marry him?

179
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,680
For an ordinary girl like me

180
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:12,640
to marry into the envied He family,

181
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,200
there's naturally a price to pay.

182
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,440
All right.

183
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,160
Then tell me

184
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,040
what I need to pay attention to

185
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,960
when taking care of
the second young master.

186
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:22,960
Then come with me.

187
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,480
Let me show you around.

188
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,400
Keep the room temperature

189
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:30,520
between 22 and 26 degrees Celsius
every day.

190
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,880
Turn him over

191
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,210
every two to four hours.

192
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,360
Open the windows for ventilation

193
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,020
for 15 to 30 minutes every day.

194
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,720
Remember to wipe his hands and face

195
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,800
every morning and evening.

196
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:47,120
And the most important thing...

197
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:49,320
You just need to talk to him every day.

198
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,680
I'm sure he can hear you.

199
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,640
Thank you for taking care of him.

200
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:57,040
He's my brother-in-law.

201
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,480
It's the least I can do.

202
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:01,200
Although he and He Shi are brothers,

203
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,420
their personalities are different.

204
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,120
He Shi is used to being arrogant.

205
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,760
But He Yu is very gentle

206
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,220
and treats everyone well.

207
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:11,210
Although He Shi and He Yu
are both my brothers,

208
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,720
the only one I truly consider my brother

209
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,880
is He Yu.

210
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,120
Give me back my doll.

211
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,050
What is this ugly thing?

212
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
I won't give it back.

213
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,330
I'm going to destroy it.

214
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,360
Brother,

215
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,960
we are Xiaomei's brothers.

216
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,880
We should take up our responsibility

217
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,280
and take good care of her.

218
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,410
She's not my sister.

219
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,440
I don't want you as my big brother.

220
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,840
I want my second brother.

221
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,080
Second brother,

222
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:39,480
I will do my best to wake you up.

223
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,800
I knew I was right about you.

224
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,600
You've taken great care of He Yu.

225
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,970
I'll get going then.

226
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,280
Second brother.

227
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,160
I'm He Mei.

228
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,960
I'm finally back.

229
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,920
If you could wake up,

230
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:16,160
you'd definitely recognize me.

231
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:17,960
Right?

232
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,210
Second brother.

233
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,300
I've missed you so much

234
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:30,120
all these years.

235
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,960
I really missed you.

236
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,040
Madam He,

237
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,880
I don't think it's appropriate

238
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:56,200
to let Li Zhangxin take care

239
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,960
of the Second Young Master.

240
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,680
After all, the hit-and-run driver
who struck him

241
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:02,320
still hasn't been found.

242
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,520
Li Zhangxin

243
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:04,800
has been scheming

244
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:06,280
to get close to him.

245
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,120
Who's to say

246
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,640
she isn't the culprit?

247
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,600
If only

248
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,360
she were the killer.

249
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,720
Zhangxin,

250
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,330
it's your first day at work.

251
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,680
Are you tired?

252
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,320
With you here, Madam,

253
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,450
I'm not tired at all.

254
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,920
Don't call me Madam.

255
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,200
I should be older than you.

256
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:43,520
Just call me Sister Roujing.

257
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:45,970
Sister Roujing.

258
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:55,880
Actually,

259
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:58,440
I had a selfish reason
for asking you to stay.

260
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,520
I don't have many friends here,

261
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,520
and I can't open up to anyone.

262
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,280
My girlfriends

263
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:12,680
all envy me for marrying
into a wealthy family.

264
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:15,360
But I care too much about my pride.

265
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:17,560
How could I tell them

266
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:20,000
the truth about my life here?

267
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,760
You're quite honest.

268
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,440
You're the same.

269
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,200
From the first time I saw you,

270
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:46,260
I felt a special connection with you.

271
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,800
Roujing,

272
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:57,080
I've always been curious about something,

273
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,560
but I don't know if I should ask.

274
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,320
Go ahead.

275
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,080
As long as I can answer it.

276
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:06,040
That butler is always
sucking up to Mrs. He.

277
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:08,400
They're both good-looking.

278
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,800
Do they have...

279
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:12,800
Are you trying to ask

280
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:15,920
if Mrs. He and the butler
are having an affair?

281
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:19,840
I'm sorry.

282
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,920
Should I not have asked that?

283
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:22,720
Let's go.

284
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,370
I'll take you to see.

285
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,200
See what?

286
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,160
I don't think this is a good idea.
